 return f'''<section class="section method-section"><div class="container method-grid"><div class="lesson-board"><div class="board-top"><span>{ico('spark')} THE “AHA!” MOMENT</span><span class="board-dots">● ● ●</span></div><div class="board-content"><div class="board-handwriting">Small steps. Big understanding.</div><div class="math-example"><div class="equation">2x + 6 = 14</div><div class="equation-step">Subtract 6 on both sides <span>2x = 8</span></div><div class="equation-step">Divide both sides by 2 <span>x = 4 {ico('check')}</span></div></div><div class="board-note">Don’t just memorise it.<br><strong>Understand it.</strong></div></div><div class="lesson-label">{ico('check')} Concept → Practice → Confidence</div></div><div class="method-copy"><div class="eyebrow">A BETTER WAY TO LEARN</div><h2>Less memorising.<br>More understanding.</h2><p>Every student learns differently. Our teaching begins with where you are, then helps you move forward with clarity.</p><div class="method-list"><div><span>01</span><div><h3>Start with the why</h3><p>Build a clear understanding before diving into formulas and answers.</p></div></div><div><span>02</span><div><h3>Make practice purposeful</h3><p>Work through problems, ask questions, and learn from mistakes.</p></div></div><div><span>03</span><div><h3>Grow at your own pace</h3><p>Get guidance shaped around your learning needs and goals.</p></div></div></div><a class="text-link" href="about.html">Get to know our approach {ico('arrow')}</a></div></div></section>'''
