subject_section=f'<section class="section subjects-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR STARTING POINT</div><h2>A subject for every<br>curious mind.</h2></div><div><p>Build the basics. Tackle the tricky bits.<br>Discover what you’re capable of.</p><a class="text-link" href="Subjects.html">View all subjects {ico("arrow")}</a></div></div>{subject_cards()}</div></section>'
